msgctxt "UI_MOD_CODE_REBUILD"
msgid "code: turning it on or off builds the game code again before you play (a few minutes)"
msgstr "程式碼：開啟或關閉會在遊玩前重新建置遊戲程式碼（需幾分鐘）"

#. Under an installed mod that ships shaders (Shader/ files).
msgctxt "UI_MOD_WARN_SHADERS"
msgid ""
"Replaces shaders: the port translates the game's shaders during the setup, so this mod may not "
"show, or may break the picture"
msgstr "取代著色器：移植版在設定過程中轉換遊戲的著色器，因此此模組可能無法顯示，或導致畫面異常"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE"
msgid "Update to %s (%d MB)"
msgstr "更新至 %s（%d MB）"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE_FETCHING"
msgid "Downloading %s"
msgstr "正在下載 %s"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATE_FAILED"
msgid "Update failed: %s"
msgstr "更新失敗：%s"

#. printf format: keep every %... conversion, in the same order.
msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_UPDATED"
msgid "Updated to %s: setting up again what it changed"
msgstr "已更新至 %s：正在重新設定有變化的部分"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_NO_GAME_DATA"
msgid "Your own copy of the game · No game data included"
msgstr "你自己的遊戲副本 · 不含任何遊戲資料"

msgctxt "UI_MENU_UPDATE_CHECK"
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "檢查更新"

msgctxt "UI_MENU_UPDATE_CHECK_DESC"
msgid ""
"At start, ask GitHub for a newer release of the port and offer it on the start screen (a few "
"seconds at most, nothing offline)."
msgstr "啟動時向 GitHub 查詢此移植版的新版本，並在開始畫面中提示（最多幾秒，離線時不做任何事）。"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_PLAYERS"
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "檔案"

msgctxt "UI_LAUNCH_PLAYER"
msgid "Profile: %s"
msgstr "檔案：%s"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_NOTE"
msgid ""
"Each profile has its own name and save, like the users of a console. The game shows the name, and "
"so do the other players' screens in LAN play."
msgstr "每個檔案都有自己的名稱和存檔，就像主機上的使用者。遊戲會顯示這個名稱，區域網路遊戲中其他玩家的畫面上也會顯示。"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_NAME_HINT"
msgid "Name (up to 10 characters)"
msgstr "名稱（最多 10 個字元）"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_CHOOSE"
msgid "Play as"
msgstr "用這個玩"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_CHOSEN"
msgid "Playing"
msgstr "使用中"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_NEW"
msgid "New profile"
msgstr "新增檔案"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_REMOVE"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_CONFIRM"
msgid ""
"Remove the profile %s? It leaves the list; its save is kept in the folder profile/players/deleted."
msgstr "移除檔案 %s？它會從清單中消失，存檔保留在 profile/players/deleted 資料夾中。"

msgctxt "UI_PLAYER_FAILED"
msgid "The profile could not be saved (the log says why)."
msgstr "無法儲存檔案（原因見記錄）。"
